{
  "name": "Generate signed invoices from data",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Multipart webhook payload\nSend these fields as `multipart/form-data`:\n- `invoiceNumber`: `INV-1001`\n- `customer`: `Ada Lovelace`\n- `customerEmail`: `ada@example.com`\n- `accountNumber`: `ACCT-1001`\n- `currency`: `USD`\n- `lineItems`: `[{\"description\":\"Consulting\",\"quantity\":2,\"unitPrice\":125}]`\n- `total`: `250`\n\nRequired file fields:\n- `pfx`: PFX signing certificate\n- `pfxPassphrase`: text file containing its passphrase\n\nOptional file fields:\n- `logo`: invoice logo image\n- `terms`: terms PDF\n\nSelect pdfRest and SMTP credentials.\n\n## Disabled nodes\nThese steps are disabled because they are optional.\n- **Add Logo**: Include `logo` and enable for branded invoices.\n- **Append Standard Terms**: Include `terms` and enable to append those pages.",
        "height": 696,
        "width": 816,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -720,
        -720
      ],
      "id": "5ea581aa-b545-4a3e-a78e-6b3c22ba563b",
      "name": "Sample Payload and Setup"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "generate-secure-invoice",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        224
      ],
      "id": "991e9276-5488-46e3-abf4-1176e50868b9",
      "name": "Receive Invoice",
      "webhookId": "547557c8-afbd-4d66-a188-ed2a98e84713"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "11e4e639-f319-46d9-a206-0cab53130f72",
              "name": "invoiceNumber",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.invoiceNumber }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "16cd70c3-b02f-49b5-ae4b-35b11f1f1e7c",
              "name": "customer",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.customer }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "35c7c424-03e8-4c79-a70f-8ea0fb0727b0",
              "name": "customerEmail",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.customerEmail }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "2e0c24cc-526f-459a-a510-39d68da296f4",
              "name": "accountNumber",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.accountNumber }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "48cf9514-bcbd-44e8-a4fd-00eb8a470e7a",
              "name": "currency",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.currency || \"USD\" }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "0e73f299-42fb-4a4f-a951-b49ba00aa6d2",
              "name": "lineItems",
              "value": "={{ typeof $json.body.lineItems === 'string' ? JSON.parse($json.body.lineItems) : $json.body.lineItems }}",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "fa6e9195-1b33-453e-a577-b14a2e811313",
              "name": "total",
              "value": "={{ Number($json.body.total) }}",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -416,
        0
      ],
      "id": "2f39cc48-a9f5-4652-a0a6-58d041e7cd7a",
      "name": "Shape Invoice Data"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "blankPdf",
        "pageCount": 1,
        "pageSize": "letter",
        "pageOrientation": "portrait",
        "downloadOutputFiles": true,
        "outputFileDataFieldName": "data",
        "options": {},
        "requestOptions": {}
      },
      "type": "CUSTOM.pdfRest",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -192,
        0
      ],
      "id": "3301cc83-6535-4fbe-a455-71201ef36292",
      "name": "Create Letter PDF",
      "notes": "Change Page Size to A4 for EU-oriented invoices.",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "credentials": {
        "pdfRestApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_PDFREST_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "pdfRest account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "addText",
        "inputType": "inputFile",
        "inputFileDataFieldName": "data",
        "textObjects": "={{ [\n  { font: 'Arial', max_width: '500', opacity: '1', page: '1', rotation: '0', text: 'INVOICE', text_color_rgb: '0,0,0', text_size: '24', x: '54', y: '720' },\n  { font: 'Arial', max_width: '500', opacity: '1', page: '1', rotation: '0', text: 'Invoice ' + $('Shape Invoice Data').item.json.invoiceNumber, text_color_rgb: '0,0,0', text_size: '12', x: '54', y: '680' },\n  { font: 'Arial', max_width: '500', opacity: '1', page: '1', rotation: '0', text: 'Customer: ' + $('Shape Invoice Data').item.json.customer, text_color_rgb: '0,0,0', text_size: '12', x: '54', y: '650' },\n  { font: 'Arial', max_width: '500', opacity: '1', page: '1', rotation: '0', text: 'Items: ' + $('Shape Invoice Data').item.json.lineItems.map(item => item.description + ' (' + item.quantity + ' × ' + item.unitPrice + ')').join('; '), text_color_rgb: '0,0,0', text_size: '10', x: '54', y: '610' },\n  { font: 'Arial', max_width: '500', opacity: '1', page: '1', rotation: '0', text: 'Total: ' + $('Shape Invoice Data').item.json.currency + ' ' + $('Shape Invoice Data').item.json.total, text_color_rgb: '0,0,0', text_size: '16', x: '54', y: '540' }\n] }}",
        "downloadOutputFiles": true,
        "outputFileDataFieldName": "data",
        "options": {},
        "requestOptions": {}
      },
      "type": "CUSTOM.pdfRest",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        32,
        0
      ],
      "id": "d2825dc8-000a-4a3a-a6fe-1dd38ac48bde",
      "name": "Add Invoice Text",
      "notes": "The layout leaves room for a future ZUGFeRD/Factur-X XML attachment. That step is not included in this version.",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "credentials": {
        "pdfRestApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_PDFREST_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "pdfRest account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "combine",
        "combineBy": "combineByPosition",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        256,
        80
      ],
      "id": "dedb31af-d2db-4519-b5f2-e8f7c6bdfce2",
